          "baseItem": ""
        },
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>The soulstitcher stabs or throws its needle. <em>Melee or Ranged Weapon Attack:</em> +7, reach 5 ft. or range 30/120 ft. <em>Hit:</em> 9 (1d10 + 4) Force damage. The needle can pass through objects and structures that aren't silver or lead, ignoring Cover provided by them. If the needle was used to make a ranged attack, the soulstitcher can pull itself in a straight line to the unoccupied space nearest to the target.</p>",
          "chat": ""
