      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>The soulstitcher scatters three ethereal pin traps into unoccupied spaces it can see within 30 feet of it. The traps are immovable, can be suspended midair, and last until triggered or until the soulstitcher takes this action again. <em>Saving Throw:</em> DC 15 Dexterity, a creature that moves within 5 feet of the trap. <em>Failure:</em> 7 (2d6) Piercing damage. <em>Success:</em> Half damage. <em>Failure or Success:</em> The trap is destroyed.</p>",
          "chat": ""
